    "CSVで保存": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save as CSV"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CSV・TSV に対応しています。区切り文字（カンマ／タブ）は自動で判定します。Chrome 拡張版おさむくんの JSON も読めます。文字コードは UTF-8 で保存してください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CSV and TSV are supported; the delimiter (comma or tab) is detected for you. JSON exported by the Osamukun Chrome extension can be read too. Files must be UTF-8."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JSONで保存": {
